-four kinds of armor were donned,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l017","ordinal":333238,"en":"And their sweeping onset blazed like fire."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l018","ordinal":333239,"en":"Stones split and mountains crumbled"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l019","ordinal":333240,"en":"As they thundered forth in menace."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l020","ordinal":333241,"en":"From the Argyn and the Kyrgyz"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l021","ordinal":333242,"en":"They formed a host of ten thousand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l022","ordinal":333243,"en":"Mustering an army in a tumult"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l023","ordinal":333244,"en":"As dust soared into the sky."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l024","ordinal":333245,"en":"They sharpened their true-steel spears,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l025","ordinal":333246,"en":"And in a single day their valor"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l026","ordinal":333247,"en":"Seemed ready to overturn"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l027","ordinal":333248,"en":"The frost-hardened black earth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l028","ordinal":333249,"en":"Then Külchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l029","ordinal":333250,"en":"Put on his bulletproof coat"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l030","ordinal":333251,"en":"And prepared himself in fury:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l031","ordinal":333252,"en":"“While our mighty heads remain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l032","ordinal":333253,"en":"Let us exact a fearful price in slaughter."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l033","ordinal":333254,"en":"If Sarybay is truly formidable,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l034","ordinal":333255,"en":"Let us go and fight him to the death!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l035","ordinal":333256,"en":"I have learned this from the chroniclers,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l036","ordinal":333257,"en":"And questioned a thousand wise men."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l037","ordinal":333258,"en":"Yesterday, when he crossed Zhan-Zhürbös,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l038","ordinal":333259,"en":"And the vast hazy desert closed around him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l039","ordinal":333260,"en":"Zharmanas of that wicked people"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0505:b003:l040","ordinal":333261,"en":"Proved to be our brother-in-law."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l001","ordinal":333262,"en":"Surely this is the day he came seeking help."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l002","ordinal":333263,"en":"Our treacherous foe Sarybay—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l003","ordinal":333264,"en":"They say Sarybay is a mighty warrior."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l004","ordinal":333265,"en":"How can we surrender the dear people"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l005","ordinal":333266,"en":"Of the Argyn and Kyrgyz"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l006","ordinal":333267,"en":"To that rabid, accursed fool?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l007","ordinal":333268,"en":"Let us face him boldly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l008","ordinal":333269,"en":"And if death has truly come, let us die!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l009","ordinal":333270,"en":"Let us fire our guns and draw our bows,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l010","ordinal":333271,"en":"And meet them in a bloody clash."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l011","ordinal":333272,"en":"Let us stand firm and die,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l012","ordinal":333273,"en":"Seeing their ranks upon the heights,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l013","ordinal":333274,"en":"Their champions and their warriors,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l014","ordinal":333275,"en":"And confronting them face-to-face."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l015","ordinal":333276,"en":"Let us shed our frail lives and spill our blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l016","ordinal":333277,"en":"Fighting them in earnest,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l017","ordinal":333278,"en":"And test ourselves in combat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l018","ordinal":333279,"en":"Against an infidel like Sarybay,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l019","ordinal":333280,"en":"A warrior beyond all reckoning,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l020","ordinal":333281,"en":"Let us clash and spill his blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l021","ordinal":333282,"en":"Breaking the bones of one another’s ribs."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l022","ordinal":333283,"en":"Let us stand amid the conflict,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l023","ordinal":333284,"en":"Give up our lives, and fight,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l024","ordinal":333285,"en":"Raising the battle standard and filling the banners,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l025","ordinal":333286,"en":"While grave calamity becomes an uproar."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l026","ordinal":333287,"en":"If hostile death arrives, let us die!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l027","ordinal":333288,"en":"Against the enemy who comes of his own accord,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l028","ordinal":333289,"en":"Let us split lungs and spill gall,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l029","ordinal":333290,"en":"Raise our cries and thrust our spears,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l030","ordinal":333291,"en":"And test ourselves in battle."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l031","ordinal":333292,"en":"If death comes from the infidel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l032","ordinal":333293,"en":"Let us behold the strength of his courage!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l033","ordinal":333294,"en":"The steep valley and its pale rocks"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l034","ordinal":333295,"en":"Are the road I was born to ride."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l035","ordinal":333296,"en":"The furious infidel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l036","ordinal":333297,"en":"A warrior of that kind,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l037","ordinal":333298,"en":"Is the prey my hand was born to take."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l038","ordinal":333299,"en":"Along the road measured out before us,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l039","ordinal":333300,"en":"With the army we ourselves have seen,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b002:l040","ordinal":333301,"en":"We shall open fire."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l001","ordinal":333302,"en":"Sarybay, son of the monster,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l002","ordinal":333303,"en":"Was left an orphan"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l003","ordinal":333304,"en":"When he reached the age of seven."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l004","ordinal":333305,"en":"Those who saw his courage were frightened."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l005","ordinal":333306,"en":"Without ever turning back, Sarybay"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l006","ordinal":333307,"en":"Has studied wondrous incantations"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l007","ordinal":333308,"en":"From that time until this."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l008","ordinal":333309,"en":"He has grown into a gray-maned wolf,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l009","ordinal":333310,"en":"And his time for vengeance has come."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l010","ordinal":333311,"en":"He has occupied a mountain fit for a war banner"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0506:b003:l011","ordinal":333312,"en":"And raised an uproar that splits the sky."}]
